      },
      "displayName": "Gert Schmeltz Pedersen",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a44f9889d5006a6c02ad",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Adam,",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "I am proposing that you perform as much of a review of this issue as you can take the time for, since you came up with it.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "The \"solution\" is in github as branch fcrepo-1018 and consists in one action that copies the fgsconfigFinal files into datastreams of a Fedora object, where they can be modified (and even further datastreams be created), and one action that copies the datastreams into the fgsconfigFinal files, where the modifications will take effect immediately.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "You may consider it without running it. If you want to run it, you need to checkout the branch, build for local test with the demo objects, and perform the two actions. Ask me, if you need assistance or clarifications.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "I look forward to your views on this, related to the needs that you envisioned.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Best, Gert",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
